00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.395
[BEEPING]

00:00:02.395 --> 00:00:04.790
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:04.790 --> 00:00:07.750
SPEAKER: Cloud IoT Core
is a fully-managed service

00:00:07.750 --> 00:00:10.780
that allows you to easily
and securely connect, manage,

00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:14.460
and ingest data from millions
of globally-dispersed devices.

00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:17.830
Cloud IoT Core, in combination
with other services on Google

00:00:17.830 --> 00:00:20.980
Cloud IoT Platform,
provides a complete solution

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:23.590
for collecting,
processing, analyzing,

00:00:23.590 --> 00:00:26.320
and visualizing IoT
data in real time

00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:29.110
to support improved
operational efficiency.

00:00:29.110 --> 00:00:31.900
Device telemetry data is
forwarded to a cloud pub/sub

00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:35.740
topic, which can then be used
to trigger cloud functions.

00:00:35.740 --> 00:00:38.050
You can also perform
streaming analysis

00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:40.870
with cloud data flow
or custom analysis

00:00:40.870 --> 00:00:42.820
with your own subscribers.

00:00:42.820 --> 00:00:45.700
This diagram summarizes
the service components

00:00:45.700 --> 00:00:47.670
in the flow of data.

00:00:47.670 --> 00:00:50.350
This hands on lab shows
you how to use Google Cloud

00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:54.490
Platform console to create a
Cloud IoT Core device registry

00:00:54.490 --> 00:00:56.450
and how to register a device.

00:00:56.450 --> 00:00:59.800
It also shows you how to run
a sample to connect the device

00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:02.110
and publish device
telemetry events.

00:01:02.110 --> 00:01:04.690
You're just one lab away
from completing your quest

00:01:04.690 --> 00:01:05.950
and getting your badge.

00:01:05.950 --> 00:01:08.350
In case you haven't been
following our other videos,

00:01:08.350 --> 00:01:10.330
a quest is a series
of related labs

00:01:10.330 --> 00:01:12.760
that form a learning
path on Qwiklabs.

00:01:12.760 --> 00:01:14.950
Completing this quest
earns you this badge

00:01:14.950 --> 00:01:17.200
to recognize your achievement.

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:19.580
Next up on our quest
is Compute Engine--

00:01:19.580 --> 00:01:21.900
Qwik Start-- Windows.

